{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>屯門發生長者鯁喉意外。今日（17日）下午5時43分，警方接獲小欖康輝路一院舍職員報案指，一名男院友進食時懷疑鯁喉暈倒。</p><p>救援人員趕至，姓姚（70歲）男事主仍然昏迷，被送往屯門醫院搶救，其後被證實死亡，死因有待驗屍後確定。據悉，姚翁事發時正進食糊仔。</p><figure><img alt=\"事主送抵屯門醫院，經搶救後不治。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260917/1177163586779222016496183.jpeg/jpDW-FDNlyg9lxQqdoCA2uGOL1Ln9SFzvAPw0rwD8NI\"/><figcaption>事主送抵屯門醫院，經搶救後不治。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T15:19:43.359500+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T15:05:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T17:57:37.481553+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T15:17:36.823632+00:00","content_hash":"36c0edbf09e38622c0e078549563c9e10c4f0119c7301fba579e73b0c917a45c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}